notes               = "Untitled in source. The third invocation of Sohrab Sepehri in this stretch (see also pages 141 and 143): 'Sohrab's gift, the water in the moon-filled glass' turns on the water that runs through all of Sepehri's work, and on his best-known injunction not to muddy it. 22 Farvardin = 11 April 1995. Imported as a draft with machine / lantern layers; ===translation=== left for Ben."
