===persian===

آه امشب...
باز می‌نوشم...
هدیه سهراب را...
آب در لیوانِ پرمهتاب را.
ابرِ سنگینی‌ست
دم‌کرده هوا اینجا...
تو کجایی تا بنوشانم به تو...
هدیه سهراب را...
آب در لیوانِ پرمهتاب را...
۱۳۷۴/۱/۲۲

===machine===

Ah, tonight...
again I am drinking...
Sohrab's gift...
the water in the moon-filled glass.
There is a heavy cloud,
the air in here is close...
Where are you, that I might give you to drink...
Sohrab's gift...
the water in the moon-filled glass...
1374/1/22

===lantern===

Ah, tonight
I am drinking it again —
Sohrab's gift,
the water in the moon-filled glass.
There is a heavy cloud;
the air in here is close.
Where are you, that I might give you to drink
Sohrab's gift,
the water in the moon-filled glass...

1374/1/22

===translation===

===footnotes===

Sohrab Sepehri's most quoted line in Persian is *let us not muddy the water* — آب را گل
نکنیم. What is handed round here as his gift is a glass of clean water with the moon in it.
